# Go changes require regression tests

Read `AGENTS.md` section “Tests and regressions (once code exists)”.

- Every area must have regression tests. A bug fix must begin with or
  include a test that fails before the fix and passes after it.
- New REST needs contract tests and shared-domain tests. New MCP needs
  protocol tests and REST/MCP parity tests. Configuration changes need
  valid, invalid, normalization, round-trip, and backward-compatibility
  tests.
- When a test target exists, run it before finishing. Do not invent
  `make test` or `make smoke` here.
